    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d238">

                <pb facs="0416" n="386" xml:id="pg386"/>

                <head>238. Telegram From the Central Intelligence Agency
                    to Operation PBSUCCESS
                        Headquarters in Florida<anchor n="1" xml:id="d238-f1"/></head>
                <dateline><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1954-06-26T23:53:00+00:00">June 26, 1954, 2353Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>06731. Ascham sends congratulations all
                    hands PBSUCCESS with regard to
                    heartening gains and improvement in situation of last forty–eight hours. He
                    particularly wishes that SHERWOOD team be
                    commended and also that SOMERSET take action commend in the name of Calligeris the pilots whose professional
                    performance and careful attention to requirements have been outstanding.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
